# [PIM](../wg/pim.html)

## Summary

The Protocols for IP Multicast (PIM) Working Group met to discuss working group status, active internet-drafts, and new protocol proposals. Key topics included native IPv4 multicast in IPv6 core networks, deterministic ECMP hashing, combining LISP PIM Join attributes into Standards Track, lessons learned from multicast deployments, IGMP/MLD proxy query message optimizations for snooping switches, PIM Flooding Mechanism (PFM) prejoin extensions, PIM-Bidir multiplane data center design considerations, and a live demonstration of the Group Assignment Protocol (GAP) over LISP.

